voidbase reimplements the HTTP API, validation rules, email templates and JS hooks surface of PocketBase
(https://pocketbase.io, MIT License, Copyright (c) 2022 - present, Gani Georgiev) on Cloudflare Workers.
The admin panel served at /_/ is PocketBase's own unmodified UI build (ui/dist), copied in by
`bun scripts/sync-panel.ts`; it stays under PocketBase's MIT license. voidbase is not affiliated with or endorsed
by the PocketBase project.

Runtime dependencies: hono (MIT), cordis (MIT), cosmokit (MIT), @standard-schema/spec (MIT), fflate (MIT), @cf-wasm/photon (Apache-2.0, Photon by Silvia O'Dwyer),
@simplewebauthn/server (MIT), bcryptjs (MIT), @resvg/resvg-wasm (MPL-2.0, resvg by the resvg authors, packaged by
yisibl/resvg-js). Built and deployed with Void (https://void.cloud).

The share card the seo plugin renders as a PNG (VOIDBASE_SEO_PNG=1) embeds a subset of Inter, in
src/server/plugins/og-font.ts, Copyright 2020 The Inter Project Authors (https://github.com/rsms/inter), licensed
under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1 (https://openfontlicense.org). The subset is generated by
`bun packages/voidbase/scripts/og-font.ts` (repository tooling, not part of the package) from google/fonts. Without
that knob neither it nor resvg is in the build.
